# The site is static (GitHub Pages). Its only setting is where the API lives.
# Secrets (Resend, Spotify, database) belong to the API: see server/.env.example.
#
# Unset in `next dev` → defaults to http://localhost:8787 (run `npm run dev` in server/).
# In production the GitHub Actions build reads it from the repo variable API_URL.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
